From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] Mobile Data quick toggle

Phones whose modem carries either calls and texts (IMS) or mobile data at a
time switch through the system's mobile mode service
(org.projectluma.MobileMode1, which owns the switch and its authorization).
A Quick Settings toggle shows that state and asks the service to switch;
it stays hidden where no such service runs. Quick Options gives it a slot.

